# vvaharness/lang/detect.py

Language classification of repository files: extension map, path and content sniffing for files the extension cannot classify (infrastructure-as-code, CI, Ansible, Kubernetes, mainframe JCL and COBOL), web-template and infrastructure-as-code predicates, security-config names, and the canonical spelling of operator-given language names.

